<h2 class="header_2"> Concept: </h2>

<p>The idea that we came up for our concept was that there is gonna be a tree in the center of our page. It is going to start out as a dead / empty tree where no leaves and no images or messages are on it. It'll just be a completely bare tree with nothing on it. Once a user adds or leaves a message, what is gonna happen is that the message that they left, whether it is an image, a couple or more lines of text, hieroglyphics, a voice memo or a GIF. Will appear onto the tree and slowly as tons of people leave their messages on the tree, a leaf / message would grow and grow and eventually be a tree filled with messages that once it gets full, the messages at the bottom 1-2 lines would disappear to make room for newer ones.</p>

